<p>
  Chiropractic care is built on the understanding that when your spine is properly aligned, your nervous system can function at its best — and your body can heal itself naturally. At Frey Clinic of Chiropractic, we provide gentle, effective adjustments tailored to each patient's needs.
</p>

<hr class="rule rule--accent" style="margin-block:var(--sp-6);" />

<h2>How chiropractic works</h2>
<p>
  Your spine protects the spinal cord, the pathway through which your brain communicates with every cell, tissue, and organ in your body. When vertebrae shift out of alignment — what chiropractors call a subluxation — that communication is disrupted. The result can be pain, reduced mobility, and diminished health.
</p>
<p>
  Through precise, controlled adjustments, we restore proper alignment to the spine, relieving pressure on nerves and allowing your body to function the way it was designed to.
</p>

<h2>What to expect</h2>
<p>
  Your first visit includes a thorough examination to understand your health history and current concerns. We'll explain our findings clearly and develop a treatment plan specific to your needs. Our adjustments are gentle — we work with your body, not against it.
</p>

